---
layout: base.njk
title: AZ Tech Tuesday — Weekly Tech & Business Happy Hour
---
<header class="pt-4 pb-5">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <img src="/img/logo.svg" alt="AZ Tech Tuesday" class="d-block mx-auto mb-3" style="width:480px;max-width:80vw;height:auto" fetchpriority="high">
    <p class="text-uppercase fw-semibold small mb-3" style="color:var(--bs-info);letter-spacing:.18em">Tuesdays · 5:30–7:30 PM</p>
    <p class="fs-4 mx-auto mb-4" style="max-width:680px">Arizona's weekly tech &amp; business happy hour. Show up, grab a drink, and meet the people building things across the Valley.</p>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-content-center mb-4">
      <a href="#rsvp" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-semibold px-4">RSVP for Next Tuesday</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline-warning btn-lg fw-semibold px-4">Become a Sponsor</a>
      <a href="https://www.meetup.com/aztechtuesday/" class="btn btn-outline-info btn-lg fw-semibold px-4">Join Meetup</a>
    </div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 gap-md-4 justify-content-center text-body-secondary small text-uppercase fw-semibold">
      <span>Every Tuesday</span><span class="text-secondary d-none d-sm-inline">·</span>
      <span>5:30–7:30 PM</span><span class="text-secondary d-none d-sm-inline">·</span>
      <span>Pick up your own tab</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="about" class="py-5 border-top border-secondary-subtle">
  <div class="container py-4">
    <p class="text-uppercase fw-semibold text-warning small mb-2">What is Tech Tuesday?</p>
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-5">A low-pressure happy hour for the Valley tech scene</h2>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-body-tertiary border-secondary-subtle">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="text-warning fw-semibold small">01</span>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mt-2">Show up</h3>
            <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">Drop into a relaxed restaurant happy hour. No agenda to sit through, no badge required.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-body-tertiary border-secondary-subtle">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="text-warning fw-semibold small">02</span>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mt-2">5–10 min spotlight</h3>
            <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">A short sponsor or theme moment — a promo, swag, or a quick intro. Then back to mingling.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-body-tertiary border-secondary-subtle">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="text-warning fw-semibold small">03</span>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mt-2">Open networking</h3>
            <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">The rest of the night is yours — founders, engineers, educators, and leaders across tech and business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="card h-100 bg-body-tertiary border-secondary-subtle">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="text-warning fw-semibold small">04</span>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mt-2">Your own tab</h3>
            <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">It's a restaurant, so you cover your own. When a sponsor's in, food and/or drinks may be on them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="events" class="py-5 border-top border-secondary-subtle">
  <div class="container py-4">
    <p class="text-uppercase fw-semibold text-warning small mb-2">Schedule</p>
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2">Events</h2>
    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-4">Every Tuesday, 5:30–7:30 PM. Past weeks are greyed out — scroll up to see them.</p>
    <div id="eventsScroll" class="table-responsive border border-secondary-subtle rounded-3" style="max-height:360px;overflow-y:auto">
      <table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0">
        <thead class="position-sticky top-0 bg-body-tertiary" style="z-index:1">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Date</th>
            <th scope="col">Location</th>
            <th scope="col">Sponsor</th>
            <th scope="col" colspan="2">Spotlight</th>
            <th scope="col" class="text-center" style="width:1%">RSVP</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="eventsBody">
          {% for e in events | sortByDate %}
          <tr data-date="{{ e.date }}">
            <td class="fw-semibold text-nowrap">{{ e.date | eventDate }}</td>
            <td>
              {% if e.location %}{% if e.url %}<a href="{{ e.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="link-warning">{{ e.location }}</a>{% else %}{{ e.location }}{% endif %}{% else %}TBD{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td>
              {% if e.sponsor %}
                {% if e.sponsor_url %}<a href="{{ e.sponsor_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="link-warning">{{ e.sponsor }}</a>{% else %}{{ e.sponsor }}{% endif %}
              {% else %}
                <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary text-nowrap" data-date="{{ e.date }}" data-target="spDate" data-past-hide>Sponsor this week</a>
              {% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="align-middle text-nowrap" style="width:1%">
              {% if e.badge %}<span class="badge text-bg-info align-middle">{{ e.badge }}</span>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="align-middle text-body-secondary small">{{ e.spotlight | safe }}</td>
            <td class="text-center text-nowrap">
              <a href="#rsvp" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-warning" data-date="{{ e.date }}" data-target="rsvpDate" data-past-hide>RSVP</a>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="members" class="py-5 border-top border-secondary-subtle">
  <div class="container py-4">
    <p class="text-uppercase fw-semibold text-warning small mb-2">The People</p>
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-5">Founding Members</h2>
    <div id="membersRow" class="row g-3">
      {% for m in members %}
      <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <div class="card bg-body-tertiary border-secondary-subtle h-100">
          <div class="card-body p-3">
            {% if m.photo %}
            <img src="/members/{{ m.photo }}" alt="{{ m.name }}" class="rounded-3 mb-3" style="width:64px;height:64px;object-fit:cover">
            {% else %}
            <div class="rounded-3 bg-secondary d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-3" style="width:64px;height:64px"><i class="bi bi-person fs-3"></i></div>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="ms-2 badge text-bg-warning mb-2">Founding Member</span>
            <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-1">{{ m.name }}</h3>
            <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">{{ m.role }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="sponsors" class="py-5 border-top border-secondary-subtle">
  <div class="container-fluid px-0 py-4">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="text-uppercase fw-semibold text-warning small mb-2">Backed By</p>
      <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2">Sponsors</h2>
      <p class="text-body-secondary mb-4">The companies who keep the room going.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container mt-5">
      <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-body-secondary fw-semibold mb-4">Founding Sponsors</h3>
      <div id="foundingRow" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-content-center">
        {% for s in sponsors %}
        <a href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-decoration-none text-reset">
          <div class="card border-0 bg-light">
            <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center p-3" style="width:160px;height:160px{% if s.needsLightBg %};background:#fff{% endif %}">
              <img src="/sponsors/{{ s.logo }}" alt="{{ s.name }}" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain">
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for i in range(sponsors.length, 6) %}
        <div class="card bg-body-tertiary border-secondary-subtle">
          <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-body-secondary p-3" style="width:160px;height:160px">
            <i class="bi bi-plus-lg fs-3"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0 mt-4">Want your logo here? <a href="#contact" class="link-warning fw-semibold">Become a sponsor →</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="py-5 border-top border-secondary-subtle">
  <div class="container py-4">
    <div class="card bg-body-tertiary border-secondary-subtle">
      <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">
        <p class="text-uppercase fw-semibold text-warning small mb-2">Become a Sponsor</p>
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Put your brand in front of the room</h2>
        <p class="text-body-secondary mb-4">Sponsors get a 5–10 minute spotlight in front of an engaged Valley tech crowd — present, demo, hand out swag, or just buy the room a round.</p>
        <form id="sponsorForm" novalidate>
          <div class="row g-3 align-items-end">
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label for="spName" class="form-label small">Name</label>
              <input id="spName" name="name" class="form-control" required>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label for="spEmail" class="form-label small">Email</label>
              <input id="spEmail" name="email" type="email" class="form-control" required>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-2">
              <label for="spDate" class="form-label small">Date</label>
              <input id="spDate" name="date" type="date" class="form-control">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-2 d-grid">
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-warning fw-semibold">Send</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="sponsorMsg" class="small mt-3" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="rsvp" class="py-5 border-top border-secondary-subtle">
  <div class="container py-4">
    <div class="card bg-body-tertiary border-secondary-subtle">
      <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">
        <p class="text-uppercase fw-semibold text-warning small mb-2">RSVP</p>
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Tell us you're coming</h2>
        <p class="text-body-secondary mb-4" style="max-width:640px">Give us a head count for Tuesday. Bringing people? Bump the number for your +1s.</p>
        <form id="rsvpForm" novalidate>
          <div class="row g-3 align-items-end">
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label for="rsvpName" class="form-label small">Name</label>
              <input id="rsvpName" name="name" class="form-control" required>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
              <label for="rsvpEmail" class="form-label small">Email</label>
              <input id="rsvpEmail" name="email" type="email" class="form-control" required>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-2">
              <label for="rsvpDate" class="form-label small">Date</label>
              <input id="rsvpDate" name="date" type="date" class="form-control">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-1">
              <label for="rsvpParty" class="form-label small">Party</label>
              <input id="rsvpParty" name="party" type="number" min="1" value="1" class="form-control">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-2 d-grid">
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-warning fw-semibold">I'm in</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="rsvpMsg" class="small mt-3" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
